---
description: Lean code: reuse, small diffs, real error handling
alwaysApply: true
---

# Code

- Reuse a helper that already exists; do not clone it.
- Smallest change that fixes the root cause for all callers.
- No interface/factory/config for a single use.
- Loading and error states required at trust boundaries. Do not empty-catch.
- Delete code you replace. Do not comment it out.
- Match existing names. Do not add a dependency without asking.
